# Project Architecture Reference: Automit CLI
This document details the core structure of the Automit tool.
**Project Folders:**
*   `src/`: Contains all primary logic modules.
*   `.agents/`: Stores project state and context files.
**Core Modules (`src/`):**
1.  `cli.js`: CLI entry point and argument handling.
2.  `config.js`: Manages system configuration (ENV > File > Default).
3.  `workflow.js`: Orchestrates the commit planning lifecycle.
4.  `git.js`: Encapsulates all standard Git interactions (diff, status).
5.  `ollama.js`: Handles interaction with external LLM APIs.
6.  `memory.js`: Manages persistent project context state (`.automait`).
